IDENTIFICATION DIVISION. PROGRAM-ID. ROOT. PROCEDURE DIVISION. CALL 'MID'. STOP RUN. IDENTIFICATION DIVISION. PROGRAM-ID. MID IS COMMON PROGRAM. PROCEDURE DIVISION. DISPLAY 'MID'.
